          <div class="od-eyebrow">Definition &amp; Core Value</div>
          <h2 class="od-section-title">What is Custom Odoo Development?</h2>
          <p class="od-section-desc">
            Odoo is an all-in-one open-source enterprise resource planning (ERP) platform. <strong>Custom Odoo Development</strong> by Hegrix Technologies transforms raw Odoo software into a tailored operational engine engineered around your exact business workflows.
